   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Reflect on the Agile methodology and the characteristics of Agile teams:\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:lower-alpha\">\n<li>How might the Agile approach be applied to a team project for a class you are in that lasts the duration of the term and has a final presentation and paper due the last week of the term?</li>\n<li>What is your ideal time period for a sprint for a semester-long team project that you are assigned and why?</li>\n<li>What tools would you use to maintain engagement in the project?</li>\n</ol>",
